  "worked_solution": "Using the sum and constant multiple rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3q(x)+4r(x))=3{q}^{\u2032}(x)+4{r}^{\u2032}(x).\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=1$, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3q(x)+4r(x))|}_{x=1} & =3{q}^{\u2032}(1)+4{r}^{\u2032}(1) \\\\  & =3(-4)+4(1) \\\\  & =-12+4 \\\\  & =-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
